WEBVTT

00:00:11.250 --> 00:00:13.870
What the heck is this? It's so confusing.

00:00:14.290 --> 00:00:16.450
There are so many useless cords here.

00:00:17.160 --> 00:00:20.750
I know nothing about VR,
but could it really be that good?

00:00:21.370 --> 00:00:24.040
What's next? I have to wear this toy?

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.540
Ha! This is so silly!

00:00:27.870 --> 00:00:29.200
I'll play for one hour,

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:33.700
do a thorough, negative review,
and sell this secondhand.

00:00:35.950 --> 00:00:37.410
Oh, it's starting!

00:00:38.660 --> 00:00:40.500
Huh? What's this?

00:00:41.160 --> 00:00:42.000
No way!

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:43.540
No way!

00:00:44.950 --> 00:00:46.950
What? I have to ride this train?

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:57.330
He's coming!

00:00:58.500 --> 00:00:59.500
He's coming!

00:01:00.040 --> 00:01:02.620
We're always riding
the same train, aren't we?

00:01:03.540 --> 00:01:04.870
It's true!

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:07.200
Everything that Retsuko said...

00:01:07.620 --> 00:01:10.790
is really true!

00:01:11.000 --> 00:01:12.040
RAGE

00:01:50.500 --> 00:01:52.120
DRIVER'S LICENSE

00:01:55.250 --> 00:01:56.290
Your business card.

00:01:56.580 --> 00:02:00.790
Ah, yes! I also wrote
my phone number on the back.

00:02:02.870 --> 00:02:04.200
ACCOUNTING DEPARTMENT
RETSUKO

00:02:04.450 --> 00:02:06.750
So this is all your fault, right?

00:02:06.830 --> 00:02:09.790
Um, yes, I guess so.

00:02:10.410 --> 00:02:13.660
Not "I guess so."
Your answer is, "That's right."

00:02:15.580 --> 00:02:16.910
I'm sorry.

00:02:21.120 --> 00:02:21.950
Huh?

00:02:22.040 --> 00:02:23.910
Wait! Where are you going?

00:02:24.000 --> 00:02:25.000
I'm going to work.

00:02:25.160 --> 00:02:27.910
But we have to be here
for the police investigation.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:31.370
I have to be at work to get things done!

00:02:31.950 --> 00:02:33.250
What?

00:02:41.540 --> 00:02:43.370
Seriously?

00:02:46.950 --> 00:02:50.000
Didn't you ask
for the other party's number?

00:02:50.450 --> 00:02:51.540
No...

00:02:51.620 --> 00:02:53.000
Have you called your insurer?

00:02:53.080 --> 00:02:54.080
I have.

00:02:56.080 --> 00:02:59.450
Well, if he's gone, then he's gone.
There's nothing we can do about that.

00:02:59.950 --> 00:03:04.660
If he contacts you at all,
please tell him to get in touch.

00:03:04.750 --> 00:03:06.330
<i>My future...</i>

00:03:06.660 --> 00:03:07.950
<i>is so grim.</i>

00:03:21.120 --> 00:03:23.870
Here are some gifts from my family trip!

00:03:24.330 --> 00:03:26.540
Wow, sounds nice. Where did you go?

00:03:26.620 --> 00:03:28.870
Karuizawa! One per person, okay?

00:03:29.870 --> 00:03:31.000
Thanks.

00:03:31.950 --> 00:03:33.450
Take yours, Retsuko!

00:03:33.910 --> 00:03:35.160
One per person, okay?

00:03:41.080 --> 00:03:43.410
One per person, please...

00:03:43.750 --> 00:03:45.580
What's with that expression?

00:03:46.040 --> 00:03:51.000
You look like that idiot acquaintance
of mine who lost his stocks.

00:03:51.620 --> 00:03:54.910
Don't bring personal issues to work.

00:03:57.000 --> 00:03:58.750
Redo this.

00:04:04.250 --> 00:04:06.620
Today, she's surviving off gifts
from Karuizawa.

00:04:06.910 --> 00:04:09.330
She needs to improve her diet.

00:04:14.450 --> 00:04:15.910
<i>One week has passed,</i>

00:04:16.370 --> 00:04:18.790
<i>with no call from that minivan guy.</i>

00:04:22.410 --> 00:04:25.410
You haven't reached
your insurance deductible yet.

00:04:25.950 --> 00:04:28.580
So it'll be 50,000 in damages
for each party

00:04:28.870 --> 00:04:30.370
and 20,000 for damage compensation.

00:04:30.700 --> 00:04:34.330
You must pay a total of 120,000 yen.

00:04:34.540 --> 00:04:39.750
However, in this case,
you can't contact the other party...

00:04:39.830 --> 00:04:41.120
So what will happen next?

00:04:41.200 --> 00:04:42.950
No idea!

00:04:44.540 --> 00:04:46.910
<i>What is he scheming?</i>

00:04:47.290 --> 00:04:49.750
<i>Maybe he'll claim later on</i>
<i>that his neck hurts.</i>

00:04:49.830 --> 00:04:52.000
<i>Maybe he'll ask</i>
<i>for outrageous compensation.</i>

00:04:52.410 --> 00:04:54.950
<i>No way, no way! That's so scary!</i>

00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:57.290
<i>Anyhow, I don't have enough money!</i>

00:04:57.870 --> 00:04:59.250
<i>I don't have enough money...</i>

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.660
<i>I don't have enough money!</i>

00:05:02.830 --> 00:05:04.330
Hey, Retsuko!

00:05:07.750 --> 00:05:08.950
Wanna get drinks today?

00:05:09.330 --> 00:05:12.950
Or even just something to eat?
Something nourishing or...

00:05:14.120 --> 00:05:15.540
I don't have enough money.

00:05:15.870 --> 00:05:16.700
What?

00:05:18.790 --> 00:05:22.040
Hey... it's my treat, okay?

00:05:25.250 --> 00:05:26.580
It's my treat...

00:05:31.040 --> 00:05:33.330
<i>Borrowing money</i>
<i>is my only option at this point!</i>

00:05:33.660 --> 00:05:36.950
<i>Ms. Gori is easily swayed</i>
<i>by emotions, so maybe...</i>

00:05:37.040 --> 00:05:39.290
CAN WE MEET TODAY?
THERE'S SOMETHING I WANT TO ASK...

00:05:40.950 --> 00:05:43.830
SURE! WANNA COME OVER?

00:05:46.620 --> 00:05:50.250
I bought it!

00:05:50.450 --> 00:05:52.200
What is this place? It's huge!

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:56.160
I've finally bought a house!

00:05:56.250 --> 00:05:59.370
<i>As expected of Director Gori</i>
<i>and her fat bank account!</i>

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:01.250
<i>I can count on her, for sure!</i>

00:06:02.250 --> 00:06:05.750
It's almost like a celebrity's house!
It's so elegant.

00:06:05.830 --> 00:06:07.830
-Oh? You really think so?
-Hmm?

00:06:07.910 --> 00:06:09.450
In that case, I'll show you

00:06:09.750 --> 00:06:13.410
the true face
of this hellish 30-year loan plan!

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:16.580
-This is from a 100-yen shop!
-What? I had no idea!

00:06:16.660 --> 00:06:19.290
This one, too! And this!
All from 100-yen shops!

00:06:20.330 --> 00:06:22.540
I made a large down payment,

00:06:22.620 --> 00:06:24.750
so I'm actually penniless now.

00:06:25.660 --> 00:06:27.620
Why did you do that?

00:06:27.790 --> 00:06:29.660
To back myself into a corner.

00:06:29.750 --> 00:06:31.910
Pressure makes us work harder,
don't you think?

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:34.540
By "working hard," you mean...

00:06:34.620 --> 00:06:36.540
Yes! My matchmaking app!

00:06:36.620 --> 00:06:37.660
GORI'S MARRIAGE COUNSELING

00:06:37.750 --> 00:06:39.540
I'll work hard at my main job, too,
of course.

00:06:39.620 --> 00:06:42.120
Just you see.
I'll work hard to make this a hit.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:45.370
And then, someday,
I'll become worthy of this house.

00:06:47.540 --> 00:06:49.700
-So what did you want to talk about?
-Huh?

00:06:49.790 --> 00:06:51.540
Didn't you have a request or something?

00:06:51.620 --> 00:06:55.200
Ah... well, actually...

00:06:55.750 --> 00:06:59.290
<i>I don't think this is the right time</i>
<i>to ask for money.</i>

00:07:01.200 --> 00:07:03.700
Oh, right! Your matchmaking app!

00:07:03.910 --> 00:07:06.250
Can I be a tester?

00:07:07.000 --> 00:07:10.500
That's what I wanted... to request...

00:07:10.580 --> 00:07:12.160
What do you mean?

00:07:12.500 --> 00:07:15.200
Life's been a bit dull,
so I figure why not spice it up?

00:07:17.700 --> 00:07:21.620
Wait, are you saying you want
to start looking for a boyfriend again?

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:24.200
Why not? Of course you can!

00:07:24.290 --> 00:07:26.790
Wait a sec.
I'll send the link to the test server.

00:07:26.870 --> 00:07:28.330
Thank you so much!

00:07:28.580 --> 00:07:31.450
ADD A NEW PHOTO
PROFILE

00:07:34.250 --> 00:07:37.200
Why do I have to drink with you?

00:07:37.290 --> 00:07:39.450
You're the one who invited me!

00:07:39.910 --> 00:07:41.330
Heh. That's true.

00:07:41.410 --> 00:07:44.120
Can I go home now?
I'm making my girlfriend wait.

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:47.950
Girlfriend? Ha! Don't lie to me.

00:07:48.040 --> 00:07:51.120
She's really a virtual girlfriend
from some VR, isn't she?

00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:53.910
From a virtual reality? No, she's not...

00:07:54.000 --> 00:07:57.830
Then call her over! Call her right now!

00:07:58.120 --> 00:07:59.790
Ah, geez! You're such a handful!

00:08:04.620 --> 00:08:07.160
<i>Washimi is the last person</i>
<i>I can count on.</i>

00:08:08.160 --> 00:08:12.750
<i>But unlike Director Gori,</i>
<i>she can be pretty cold...</i>

00:08:23.790 --> 00:08:25.120
<i>Huh? Who's this?</i>

00:08:28.330 --> 00:08:29.200
Hello?

00:08:29.290 --> 00:08:30.750
<i>Hey, Missy?</i>

00:08:33.080 --> 00:08:35.750
<i>I'm near your house right now.</i>

00:08:35.830 --> 00:08:38.700
CAFÉ

00:08:42.080 --> 00:08:43.910
Man, my neck hurts...

00:08:47.620 --> 00:08:48.450
Um...

00:08:48.910 --> 00:08:52.790
After the accident,
the police said they wanted you...

00:08:53.620 --> 00:08:56.700
to contact... them...

00:08:58.160 --> 00:08:59.910
What did you tell the police?

00:09:00.290 --> 00:09:01.250
Huh?

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:06.790
Your car crashed into my parked car
due to your bad driving.

00:09:07.160 --> 00:09:08.370
Am I wrong?

00:09:08.910 --> 00:09:11.540
Yes, that's the gist of it.

00:09:12.040 --> 00:09:14.330
In which case, I am not at fault.

00:09:14.700 --> 00:09:16.370
I won't contact the police.

00:09:16.450 --> 00:09:18.410
What? That's a bit problematic!

00:09:20.040 --> 00:09:23.660
Shut up.
I'm the one who gets to say that.

00:09:24.750 --> 00:09:26.250
If I am not at fault,

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:29.620
then my insurer
is unable to negotiate with you.

00:09:29.700 --> 00:09:31.120
That is the law.

00:09:31.370 --> 00:09:35.330
In other words, I have to talk
with your insurer myself.

00:09:35.410 --> 00:09:37.620
Depending on the situation,
a lawyer may be needed.

00:09:38.040 --> 00:09:41.200
Why do I, as the victim,
have to handle such a troublesome... Ouch!

00:09:45.870 --> 00:09:48.450
<i>He's really forcing</i>
<i>my attention to his neck!</i>

00:09:48.790 --> 00:09:53.080
<i>He'll definitely make me cover</i>
<i>outrageous medical expenses!</i>

00:09:56.160 --> 00:09:57.290
A settlement agreement.

00:09:57.660 --> 00:10:00.120
Once you sign that,
we can process our agreement.

00:10:00.200 --> 00:10:01.080
SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT

00:10:01.160 --> 00:10:03.120
<i>This has to be some shady agreement.</i>

00:10:03.330 --> 00:10:05.830
<i>I will definitely be in trouble</i>
<i>if I sign this!</i>

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:08.950
Um...

00:10:09.120 --> 00:10:12.910
I know I caused you a lot of trouble,
and I am really sorry,

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:15.370
but please have a doctor
detail your injury,

00:10:15.450 --> 00:10:18.120
and report it to your insurance company!

00:10:18.450 --> 00:10:19.660
My injury?

00:10:20.330 --> 00:10:22.290
Where does it say anything about that?

00:10:22.370 --> 00:10:23.250
Huh?

00:10:24.750 --> 00:10:25.910
SETTLEMENT AGREEMENT

00:10:26.000 --> 00:10:27.500
TWO HUNDRED THOUSAND YEN PAYMENT

00:10:27.580 --> 00:10:30.830
ALL SETTLEMENTS WILL THEREBY BE CLOSED,
WITH NO ADDITIONAL PAYMENTS REQUIRED

00:10:30.910 --> 00:10:33.790
<i>It's actually... pretty fair?</i>

00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:40.290
Hey, Anai.

00:10:41.450 --> 00:10:45.830
Actually, I wanna try out a VR.
Let me try yours.

00:10:45.910 --> 00:10:47.500
I told you, I don't have one!

00:10:47.580 --> 00:10:48.790
Don't hide it from me!

00:10:48.870 --> 00:10:52.040
Come on, it's not even 8:00 p.m. yet!
How can you be so wasted?

00:10:54.250 --> 00:10:56.250
Anai? Welcome home!

00:10:57.160 --> 00:10:59.750
I'm home. Sorry! Were you working?

00:10:59.830 --> 00:11:02.290
Yeah, I added a bit to the draft.

00:11:02.620 --> 00:11:04.700
Really? Thanks.

00:11:04.790 --> 00:11:06.830
Wait a second. I'll open the door.

00:11:09.870 --> 00:11:11.660
Oh... Hello.

00:11:13.450 --> 00:11:16.120
-What a realistic VR.
-This is reality!

00:11:16.580 --> 00:11:19.290
Nice to meet you. I'm Hakumi.

00:11:19.750 --> 00:11:21.750
Ah, hello.

00:11:25.250 --> 00:11:27.750
RETSUKO
PERSONAL STAMP

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:31.500
Here you go.

00:11:31.700 --> 00:11:32.660
Thanks.

00:11:35.040 --> 00:11:36.160
20,000 yen?

00:11:36.580 --> 00:11:39.500
I'm sorry!
That's all I can pay right now!

00:11:39.700 --> 00:11:42.910
I left in the middle of work for this,
you know.

00:11:45.500 --> 00:11:46.790
What the heck is this?

00:11:51.410 --> 00:11:54.040
KEEP IT TOGETHER! - MOM

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:00.370
I don't have the money right now,

00:12:00.500 --> 00:12:02.750
but I promise I'll pay you later.

00:12:02.830 --> 00:12:05.580
And I swear I will handle this properly.

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:08.120
I'll take side jobs or something
to make money!

00:12:10.910 --> 00:12:12.000
Side jobs?

00:12:12.330 --> 00:12:13.950
Do you have anything in mind?

00:12:14.040 --> 00:12:16.870
No, but I'll start looking.

00:12:20.120 --> 00:12:22.200
You do accounting, right?

00:12:22.700 --> 00:12:23.750
Yes.

00:12:24.950 --> 00:12:26.290
I'll give you a job.

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:28.580
Come with me.

00:12:37.620 --> 00:12:40.450
<i>Where is he taking me?</i>

00:12:43.370 --> 00:12:48.410
Excuse me, what line of work are you in?

00:12:48.750 --> 00:12:49.950
You'll see for yourself.

00:12:50.040 --> 00:12:51.620
<i>I'd rather not!</i>

00:12:54.120 --> 00:12:55.250
-Get out.
-Okay.

00:12:56.120 --> 00:12:57.620
-Hurry up.
-Okay.

00:13:04.160 --> 00:13:05.750
Oh, no...

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:08.120
What are you doing? Come quick.

00:13:20.830 --> 00:13:23.040
<i>O! T! M!</i>

00:13:23.790 --> 00:13:26.160
<i>O! T! M!</i>

00:13:44.620 --> 00:13:47.620
<i>I want to be a viral star</i>

00:13:47.700 --> 00:13:50.830
<i>On a shiny stage somewhere</i>

00:13:50.910 --> 00:13:53.790
<i>It may be sad but I still dream</i>

00:13:53.870 --> 00:13:55.330
<i>In the darkness of my mind</i>

00:13:55.410 --> 00:13:58.250
Hey! Don't just stare mindlessly.
Give it more hype!

00:13:58.540 --> 00:14:02.040
You too! Get closer. Come on. You too!

00:14:04.620 --> 00:14:05.450
Good.

00:14:05.870 --> 00:14:10.200
You, you, and you, in this moment,

00:14:10.290 --> 00:14:13.080
the three of you
are the greatest girls in the world!

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.870
Guys! Cheer more!

00:14:18.620 --> 00:14:22.250
One, two! O.T.M.

00:14:26.910 --> 00:14:28.450
<i>What is going on here?</i>

00:14:54.540 --> 00:14:57.540
Subtitle translation by: Rachael Momber
